### Rust ###
# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables
debug/
target/

# Keep Cargo.lock tracked for reproducible binary/workspace builds

# These are backup files generated by rustfmt
**/*.rs.bk

# MSVC Windows builds of rustc generate these, which store debugging information
*.pdb

# End of https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/api/rust

*.sh
*.txt
*.md
!README.md
!AGENTS.md
!CLAUDE.md
!doc_gen/**/*.md
!docs/*.md
# Audit evidence chain: track all audit reports and working docs under docs/.
!docs/
!docs/audit/
!docs/**
!docs/**/*.md
*.bak

fuzz/
**/bench_data/
**/test_shell/
.sisyphus/
.opencode/
.cross-review/
.tmp*
tmp*
logs/
*.log
settings.json
